rl":"https://api.github.com/users/febucci/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/febucci/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/febucci/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/febucci/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/febucci/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-14T12:21:14Z","updated_at":"2026-02-14T12:21:14Z","body":"Adding the same! Me and team have the same issue; disabling \"embed game\" [...] fixes it. \n\nGodot Engine v4.6.stable.official.89cea1439 - https://godotengine.org\nD3D12 12_0 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: NVIDIA - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER, Win11","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3901815582/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3956977426","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115972#issuecomment-3956977426","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115972","id":3956977426,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7r2q8S","user":{"login":"Cabbage0211","id":116654539,"node_id":"U_kgDOBvQByw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116654539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cabbage0211","html_url":"https://github.com/Cabbage0211","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cabbage0211/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cabbage0211/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cabbage0211/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cabbage0211/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cabbage0211/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cabbage0211/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cabbage0211/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cabbage0211/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cabbage0211/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-25T05:39:29Z","updated_at":"2026-03-25T15:57:41Z","body":"Adding the same.  disabling \"embed game\" [...] fixes it.\nVulkan and D3D12 same.\nGodot Engine v4.6.1.stable.steam.14d19694e - https://godotengine.org\nVulkan 1.4.329 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: AMD - AMD Radeon RX 9070 XT\n\nEdit: AMD newest driver 26.3.1 seems fix this. No freeze anymore for now. I'll edit this post if any freeze occurs\nEdit 2: Still there.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3956977426/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4011342226","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115972#issuecomment-4011342226","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115972","id":4011342226,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vGDmS","user":{"login":"GreenCrowDev","id":62719360,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzE5MzYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62719360?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev","html_url":"https://github.com/GreenCrowDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-06T12:01:19Z","updated_at":"2026-03-07T00:39:57Z","body":"Same issue.\n\nGodot Engine v4.6.1.stable.official.14d19694e - https://godotengine.org\nD3D12 12_0 - Forward Mobile - Using Device #0: NVIDIA - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Ti\nWindows 11\nCPU AMD Ryzen 5 7600 6-Core Processor, 3801 Mhz, 6 core, 12 processori logici\nDriver NVIDIA Studio 576.80\n\nDrivers are pretty old, I should try to update them.\n\nI'd like to know if there's any way I can help debugging this.\nI'm familiar with debugging the engine with breakpoints but I'm not sure how to start investigating this issue.\nAny suggestion?\n\n> I assume you have an AMD integrated GPU too. Could you check which version of the AMD Adrenalin drivers you have, and try to update it?\n\nOh, just saw the message from @akien-mga to try to update AMD drivers, since my CPU also has integrated graphics.\nI'll try that and update this comment.\n\nEDIT: Just found out that I don't have AMD Adrenalin installed. I'm honestly a bit scared to try installing it having a NVIDIA GPU, and I don't want to mess up my setup (on the web people seem to discourage installing these kind of conflicting drivers it seems). Anything else to try?\n\nEDIT 2: I'm trying to debug enabling Windows Graphics Tools and DirectX Control Panel executing `dxcpl.exe`.\nI'm testing with the latest master commit with `platform=windows target=editor dev_build=yes`.\nI enabled Direct3D/DXGI Debug Layer through Force On in the DirectX Control Panel, then attaching the VSCode cppvsdbg debugger to the editor, and I'm able to get warnings when the windows refreshes.\n\nThis is what I found out;\n* Without any DirectX debugging mode turned on, I'm able to get the freeze/hand in the first 4 tries by just playing and stopping a blank scene in a new project;\n* With Direct3D/DXGI Debug Layer Force On, instead, I'm literally unable to reproduce the freeze/hang. It happened just one time and I didn't have the debugger attached unfortunately.\n\nNot sure if this means anything, as I'm not familiar with this.\n\nEDIT 3: I'm using NVIDIA Nsight Systems to profile the process, I'll update you soon.\n\nEDIT 4: I managed to get this timeline with NVIDI Nsight, but I'm not sure where to go from there. The two blue blocks should represent the freeze/hang.\n\n<img width=\"2224\" height=\"925\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c75eef5b-9d77-49f3-9cd5-4c0d513959dc\" />\n\nEDIT 5: One of the culprit seems this line:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/220b0b2f74d8e089481b140c42a42992a76dd6fc/drivers/d3d12/rendering_device_driver_d3d12.cpp#L2541\n\nI tested this calculating the duration, and I was able to get a print in the editor with this code:\n\n```cpp\nHRESULT res;\nbool any_present_failed = false;\nfor (uint32_t i = 0; i < p_swap_chains.size(); i++) {\n\tSwapChain *swap_chain = (SwapChain *)(p_swap_chains[i].id);\n\n\tuint64_t my_start = OS::get_singleton()->get_ticks_usec();\n\n\tres = swap_chain->d3d_swap_chain->Present(swap_chain->sync_interval, swap_chain->present_flags);\n\n\tuint64_t my_end = OS::get_singleton()->get_ticks_usec();\n\tuint64_t my_duration = my_end - my_start;\n\n\tif (my_duration > 50000) {\n\t\tprint_line(vformat(\"D3D12 Present stall: %d us (%.2f ms)\", my_duration, my_duration / 1000.0));\n\t}\n\n\tif (!SUCCEEDED(res)) {\n\t\tprint_verbose(vformat(\"D3D12: Presenting swapchain failed with error 0x%08ux.\", (uint64_t)res));\n\t\tany_present_failed = true;\n\t}\n}\n```\n\nEven though, other stalls didn't call the `print_line()` function, meaning that the issue is also somewhere else...","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4011342226/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4035306068","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115972#issuecomment-4035306068","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115972","id":4035306068,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7wheJU","user":{"login":"GreenCrowDev","id":62719360,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzE5MzYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62719360?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev","html_url":"https://github.com/GreenCrowDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-11T00:14:37Z","updated_at":"2026-03-11T00:15:45Z","body":"I tried to bisect the issue, but wasn't useful.\n\nI found out the issue occurs even for 4.4, the first Godot version with the Game embedded workspace.\nThat means we can't reproduce it before that (or maybe we can?...)\n\nI confirm this issue is related to DX12. Vulkan is fine, I cannot reproduce it (at least on my end).\nI used a blank Godot project.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4035306068/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4330450661","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115972#issuecomment-4330450661","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115972","id":4330450661,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAh1u5Q","user":{"login":"Tetane","id":13542748,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTQyNzQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13542748?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tetane","html_url":"https://github.com/Tetane","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tetane/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tetane/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tetane/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tetane/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tetane/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tetane/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tetane/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tetane/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tetane/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-27T21:06:46Z","updated_at":"2026-04-27T21:06:46Z","body":"I also have this bug (not all the time but most of the time) when I stop the game if it's embedded in the editor, the workspace is not floating and using D3D12. I had to switch back to Vulkan. (Godot v4.6.2.stable.official [71f334935])\nMy laptop:\nOS: Windows 11\nCPU: Intel Core i7-10750H\nGPU: NVidia RTX 2060","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4330450661/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4333485206","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115972#issuecomment-4333485206","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115972","id":4333485206,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAku8lg","user":{"login":"jaydensipe","id":47132280,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTMyMjgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47132280?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe","html_url":"https://github.com/jaydensipe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-28T08:17:15Z","updated_at":"2026-04-28T08:17:15Z","body":"I also get this issue.\n\nGodot v4.7.beta (1da362036) - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 7900 XTX (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.23033.1002) - AMD Ryzen 9 7950X 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 31.58 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4333485206/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4365032908","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115972#issuecomment-4365032908","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115972","id":4365032908,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBC0dzA","user":{"login":"jaydensipe","id":47132280,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTMyMjgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47132280?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe","html_url":"https://github.com/jaydensipe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-03T00:28:42Z","updated_at":"2026-05-03T00:28:42Z","body":"So I luckily had another project that this wasn't happening on (DirectX 12), and I believe I found what's causing this (and potentially another AMD driver crash for me).\n\nVSYNC!!! Set `V-Sync Mode` to `Disabled` under **Project Settings** (_the one in Editor Settings did not prevent this for me_). This prevents the freezing for me when I am running the game embedded, see if it helps you all as well. You can then set a `Max FPS` in **Project Settings** too, to prevent your GPU from going crazy.\n\n<img width=\"1278\" height=\"318\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f1c5bde8-8cde-4279-9b14-2b1f1dbbc0bb\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4365032908/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4365982097","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115972#issuecomment-4365982097","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115972","id":4365982097,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBDuZkQ","user":{"login":"Tetane","id":13542748,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTQyNzQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13542748?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tetane","html_url":"https://github.com/Tetane","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tetane/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tetane/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tetane/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tetane/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tetane/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tetane/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tetane/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tetane/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tetane/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-03T10:47:15Z","updated_at":"2026-05-03T10:47:15Z","body":"> So I luckily had another project that this wasn't happening on (DirectX 12), and I believe I found what's causing this (and potentially another AMD driver crash for me).\n> \n> VSYNC!!! Set `V-Sync Mode` to `Disabled` under **Project Settings** (_the one in Editor Settings did not prevent this for me_). This prevents the freezing for me when I am running the game embedded, see if it helps you all as well. You can then set a `Max FPS` in **Project Settings** too, to prevent your GPU from going crazy.\n\n@jaydensipe Good catch!\n\nAfter some tests I also found out that the `Mailbox` mode does not trigger the freeze.\nV-Sync:\n- Enabled or Adaptive -> Freeze\n- Disabled or Mailbox -> No freeze\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4365982097/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4410748924","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115972#issuecomment-4410748924","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115972","id":4410748924,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBuav_A","user":{"login":"dpnnl","id":84047200,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MDQ3MjAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/84047200?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpnnl","html_url":"https://github.com/dpnnl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpnnl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpnnl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpnnl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpnnl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpnnl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpnnl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpnnl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpnnl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpnnl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-09T00:24:26Z","updated_at":"2026-05-09T00:24:26Z","body":"Hi! I have the same problem, even without using \"embedded\". Also using DX12.\n\nV-Sync + Mailbox & Max FPS solves the problem.\n\nGodot v4.7.beta1 - Windows 11 (build 26300) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Mobile) - dedicated Intel(R) Iris(R) Xe Graphics (Intel Corporation; 32.0.101.6881) - 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-1165G7 @ 2.80GHz (8 threads) - 15.78 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4410748924/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4906992665","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115972#issuecomment-4906992665","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115972","id":4906992665,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJHrEGQ","user":{"login":"SlimeOnGit","id":191422079,"node_id":"U_kgDOC2jefw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191422079?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SlimeOnGit","html_url":"https://github.com/SlimeOnGit","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SlimeOnGit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SlimeOnGit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SlimeOnGit/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SlimeOnGit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SlimeOnGit/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SlimeOnGit/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SlimeOnGit/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SlimeOnGit/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SlimeOnGit/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-07T18:05:20Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T18:05:20Z","body":"I have the same issue in both Godot 4.7 and 4.7.1.rc1.\n\nAfter running the project and then stopping/closing the game, the editor randomly freezes for around 2 seconds, then returns to normal.\n\nDisabling V-Sync fixed the issue for me.\n\nTested versions:\n- v4.7.stable.official\n- v4.7.1.rc1.official.17e2686e0\n\nWorkaround:\n- Disable V-Sync\n\nSystem info:\nD3D12 12_0 - Forward+ - Using NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090\nOS: Windows 11 Pro 25H2\nCPU: Ultra 9 285K\nRAM: 64.0 GB \nGPU driver: 596.36\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4906992665/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5230113129","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115972#issuecomment-5230113129","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115972","id":5230113129,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABN70xaQ","user":{"login":"CodeSmith32","id":21373557,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzczNTU3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21373557?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeSmith32","html_url":"https://github.com/CodeSmith32","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeSmith32/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeSmith32/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeSmith32/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeSmith32/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeSmith32/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeSmith32/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeSmith32/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeSmith32/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeSmith32/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-09T06:16:52Z","updated_at":"2026-08-09T06:16:52Z","body":"Same here! Unembedding the game window, or setting V-Sync to \"Disabled\" or \"Mailbox\" also worked for me.\nReporting my OS details too, in case it helps:\n\nGodot v4.6.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8129) - AMD Ryzen AI 7 350 w/ Radeon 860M (16 threads) - 15.28 GiB memory","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5230113129/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]